cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EpiFitScout, please cite it as below, together with MASTER and SAbDab."
title: "EpiFitScout: epitope-complementary CDR fragment retrieval"
abstract: >-
  Given a query CDR loop and its bound epitope, EpiFitScout searches a chain
  database derived from SAbDab for structurally similar CDR fragments that are
  geometrically complementary to the epitope surface.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ashraf
    given-names: Faisal B.
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/fbabd/epifitscout"
keywords:
  - antibody
  - CDR
  - epitope
  - shape complementarity
  - structural bioinformatics
references:
  - type: article
    title: "The design and application of structural motif libraries: MASTER"
    authors:
